      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Usage records can omit the profile that actually ran",
      "description": "`_build` takes the profile only from `resolved.profile`. When a model is supplied as a bare ID, that field can be `None`, even though dispatch selects a concrete profile (for example, the explicit `profile` parameter or the SDK default). The resulting record loses which provider profile produced its usage. Pass the selected profile into the record builder, or otherwise resolve it from the actual dispatch path.",
